        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The diagram below shows the recycling process of aluminium cans. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ElRCdLk1Qo4Y9fxQ7WUlnNrWgrg\"><em><strong>The diagram below shows the recycling process of aluminium cans. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Recycling Process of Aluminium Cans</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\nĐề b&agrave;i Recycling Process of Aluminium Cans y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về quy tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế lon nh&ocirc;m</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction </strong></span></h3>\n<strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Recycling Process of Aluminium Cans với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế lon nh&ocirc;m - UK</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X1D8dbfFNoPW2sxATZhlWa40gwb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>to&agrave;n bộ quy tr&igrave;nh c&oacute; 7 bước.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LWwUd95Owok4CXxyF5blHSeIgoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh bắt đầu từ việc thu gom lon nh&ocirc;m v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c bằng việc t&aacute;i sử dụng</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> 4 bước đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FvEYdRrSGo3Jqcxt55alQorzgYd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HCqrdLxYKoROV2xhGT9lb4lugad\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>lon nh&ocirc;m ko được d&ugrave;ng nữa sẽ được bỏ v&agrave;o <strong>th&ugrave;ng r&aacute;c t&aacute;i chế</strong> (recycling bins)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BodkdtlM0o907PxrNKFlKcFBgYb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>được thu gom bởi <strong>xe thu gom r&aacute;c t&aacute;i chế</strong> (recycling trucks)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CUnldpRzRoCe4ZxJKGvlXpXcg6z\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>những lon nh&ocirc;m sẽ được <strong>rửa sạch</strong> (cleaning), <strong>ph&acirc;n loại </strong>(sorting), <strong>cắt th&agrave;nh mảnh nhỏ</strong> (shredding), <strong>&eacute;p lại </strong>(compressing)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QMAFdDrSuoIxkgxJsi8lWhBBg48\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>sau khi đ&atilde; qua c&aacute;c bước xử l&yacute; tr&ecirc;n th&igrave; sẽ được nấu l&ecirc;n để <strong>chảy</strong> (melt) ra th&agrave;nh <strong>nh&ocirc;m dạng lỏng</strong> (liquid)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 3 bước c&ograve;n lại của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VwnxdTHV3odWiwxY4cvlMTVygtb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>nh&ocirc;m dạng lỏng được cuộn th&agrave;nh miếng d&agrave;y khoảng từ 2.5mm đến 6mm</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KMTxdFbLAoppR9xsa8vlCQJFgve\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>những miếng nh&ocirc;m n&agrave;y được t&aacute;i chế th&agrave;nh lon mới</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JzQHdtDtOoUXGDxWRlQl6Oqdgxe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>lon nh&ocirc;m t&aacute;i chế được t<strong>&aacute;i sử dụng </strong>(reusing)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 572,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WCcDdbnQIoLJg0xEnmsl8kleg8j\">The diagram illustrates the complete cycle of aluminium can recycling process in the UK, from collection to reuse.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13831,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 573,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MxKndeXRBoTSulxYjF0lYqkCgiN\">Overall, this circular process consists of seven main stages with various mechanical and thermal procedures, beginning with the collection of used aluminium cans and ending with reusing.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13831,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 574,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N8OpdA11qoQiFOxTZKtllQu1gix\">At the start, people dispose of used cans in designated aluminium recycling bins, which are then collected by recycling trucks. Following this, the cans undergo several preparatory steps including cleaning, sorting, shredding, and compressing. Thereafter, the processed material is then subjected to heating and melting, which transforms the solid aluminium into a liquid state.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13831,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 575,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W02ZdVg7tons6oxIdO4lKgOygCg\">In the subsequent stage of the process, the melted aluminium is rolled into sheets measuring between 2.5mm and 6mm in thickness. These sheets then enter the recycling phase where they are formed into new cans. Finally, the cycle completes at the reusing stage, where 74% of aluminium cans are recycled to be distributed for consumer use.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13831,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
